en&amp;#39;t ...</title><content type='html'>Methods to embroil us in endless wars haven&amp;#39;t changed since the War of Northern Aggression.  From it&amp;#39;s infancy Hollywood was employed to transmit propaganda concerning Imperial German atrocities all the while conveniently ignoring those of the British.  While German atrocities were largely fictional the British blockade during and AFTER WW1 did kill many German children.  George Creel a Hollywood director headed up the  Department of Public Information.  The methods are the same only the mediums of transmission are different.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4382350287872526759/comments/default/4080111419963945741'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4382350287872526759/comments/default/4080111419963945741'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/02/war-partys-atrocity-porn.html?showComment=1298822684825#c4080111419963945741' title=''/><author><name>Outer Hebrides</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18188308493222633746</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/_U4p3Hy69GLA/SoSe82MyREI/AAAAAAAAAAM/5uvOmvIoPrQ/S220/DSC02674.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/02/war-partys-atrocity-porn.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4382350287872526759' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4382350287872526759' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-83286838"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 27, 2011 at 9:04 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5218541430699571059</id><published>2011-02-27T06:00:13.307-07:00</published